        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sir William James Ingram, Herbert Ingram\n- Organizations: The Illustrated London News, House of Commons\n- Roles: Managing Director, Liberal politician, Member of Parliament\n\nFacts:\n- Sir William James Ingram, 1st Baronet, was born on 27 October 1847 and died on 18 December 1924.\n- The Illustrated London News was founded by Herbert Ingram.\n- Sir William James Ingram, 1st Baronet, was Managing Director of The Illustrated London News.\n- Sir William James Ingram, 1st Baronet, was a Liberal politician who sat in the House of Commons during three periods between 1878 and 1895.\n- The Illustrated London News was published weekly until 1971.\n- The Illustrated London News was published less frequently after 1971.\n- The Illustrated London News ceased publication in 2003.",
